//! Suica Card Dump Utility
//!
//! This utility dumps information from Suica cards using FeliCa encryption.
//! Keys are loaded from a JSONL file generated by `keys_csv_to_jsonl`.
//!
//! # Usage
//!
//! Local reader:
//! ```bash
//! cargo run --example dump_suica -- --keys keys.jsonl
//! ```
//!
//! With station code lookup:
//! ```bash
//! cargo run --example dump_suica -- --keys keys.jsonl --station-codes station_codes.csv
//! ```
//!
//! Remote reader:
//! ```bash
//! cargo run --example dump_suica -- --keys keys.jsonl --station-codes station_codes.csv --remote 127.0.0.1:7878
//! ```

